*** Keywords ***
the page is showing Sign Up form
    User membuka aplikasi GherkinPilot
    User tap button "Register Here"
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    //android.widget.ScrollView
    Sleep    1s


I fill in Nama Lengkap "${nama_lengkap}"
    Click Element    android=new UiSelector().className("android.widget.EditText").instance(0)
    Input Text    android=new UiSelector().className("android.widget.EditText").instance(0)    ${nama_lengkap}
    Sleep    1s

I fill in Registered Email "${email}"
    Click Element    android=new UiSelector().className("android.widget.EditText").instance(1)
    Input Text    android=new UiSelector().className("android.widget.EditText").instance(1)    ${email}
    Sleep    1s

 I choose Tipe Akun "${tipe_akun}"
    Click Element    ${tipe_akun}
    Sleep    2s

I click agree of term of condition
    Click Element    //android.widget.CheckBox
    Sleep    1s

I should see activated button "Lanjutkan"
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    android=new UiSelector().description("Continue")
    Sleep    1s

I click button "Lanjutkan"
    Click Element    android=new UiSelector().description("Continue")
    Sleep    1s   

I should see error message notification "${err_msg}"
    Run Keyword If    '${err_msg}' == 'Email Sudah Terdaftar'     Wait Until Page Contains    Email sudah terdaftar        #//android.view.View[@content-desc="Error 400\nEmail sudah terdaftar"]    5s 
    ...     ELSE IF   '${err_msg}' == 'Email Tidak Valid'    Wait Until Page Contains Element    //android.view.View[@content-desc="Please enter a valid email"]    5s 
    ...     ELSE    Log To Console    Validasi Belum Lengkap
    Capture Page Screenshot